  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC10_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ah, finally. I've a note for you from that Sparck chap, because apparently I'm the Arcanum Postman too. The note reads:",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LibrarianFitzhume_EM2_02.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1346371,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC10_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>Wizard, Captain Pork and I have returned to Aeriel to refine the Intra-Aethyrial Navigational System, as well as study the enigmatic Aethyr... </ITALICS>",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LibrarianFitzhume_EM2_03.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1346371,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC10_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oof, then there's a page of techno-babble... He says they're 'installing Sensors'... blah blah... terrorpeptide fluctuations... and he ends with:",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LibrarianFitzhume_EM2_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1346371,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC10_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>All this, of course, is for naught without young Mellori. Please consult with Beans and the Scholars, then rendezvous with us in Nowhere Village. </ITALICS>",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LibrarianFitzhume_EM2_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1346371,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC10_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Well, you heard the Nimbari. Scholar Zander and the surly Pigman are looking after Mellori in Recovery Room A. Go on then!",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LibrarianFitzhume_EM2_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1346371,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC10_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I'm not your personal secretary, you know. Sparck wants you to talk to Dr. Beans about what you're all going to do about Mellori. So, go!",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LibrarianFitzhume_EM2_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1346371,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
